/* =====================================================================
   inline-link body anchor unify — boss-QA cycle 31, ship #53
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   The body-text anchor family (legal-doc a / profile-link / csfloat-
   text-anchor / db-name a) shares a neutral pattern: --ink color +
