/* END FAQ chevron polish */

/* =====================================================================
   filter-rarity-row hover de-blue — boss-QA cycle 31, ship #72
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   .filter-rarity-row:hover paints with --cta 8% wash — every Rarity
