/* END nav-link-badge polish */

/* =====================================================================
   csfloat-home-hero-title clamp on-scale — boss-QA cycle 31, ship #77
   ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   The home-hero title clamp endpoints are clamp(28px, 4.2vw, 56px).
