/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #1109 — drawer slide-in timing
   csfloat measure: .mat-drawer / side panels slide in with the
   Material standard 400ms cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1). sboxmarket
   side panels and filter drawers default to 0.3s ease which feels
