   Measured sboxmarket .inventory-item: 196x253 box, panel bg, 8px
   radius (close to csfloat 8px target — already on token), but the
   typography below the thumb drifts: .inventory-name 12.5px / 500
   reads small but Geist Mono leaks into .inventory-floor (11px mono).
   csfloat sell-inventory cards (the smaller "select to list" grid)
   spec — measured against the csfloat market card baseline scaled
   down for the inventory variant:
     name:  Roboto 13px / 500, rgb(255,255,255), 1-line clamp
     price: Roboto 13px / 600, rgb(255,255,255), tabular-nums
