   2px border, var(--highlight-background-minimal) background, 14px padding
   on desktop, 12px on mobile. Localhost was rendering this drawer with
   border-radius 8 and no border which read as a flat strip. Tighten so the
   drawer reads as a sibling of the modal surface. */
