/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #2400 — /changelog page bg + container.
   Measure: csfloat body bg = rgb(21,23,28), Roboto inherited, page
   max 940px. Pre-fix sbox /changelog had max 820px. Pin csfloat
   tokens explicitly so the page chrome aligns with /faq/db pages. */
body:has(main.changelog) {
