/* END CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #2403 */

/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #2404 — release date eyebrow.
   Measure: csfloat label-eyebrows = Roboto 12px/600/uppercase in
   rgb(158,167,177) with 0.6px letter-spacing. Pre-fix sbox
   .changelog-date was 11px Geist in csfloat-blue. Eyebrows should be
