/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #2611 — watchlist grid + card spacing tune.
   Measure: csfloat watchlist grid uses 16px gap (not 12px from
   editorial density) between cards. Each card = 200px min, auto-fill,
   1px hairline rgba(255,255,255,0.08) border, 8px radius. The alert
