/* END CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #2900 */

/* CSFLOAT-1:1 PARITY ship #2901 — .buyorder-title / .buyorder-sub typography
   csfloat list-row primary text: Roboto 14/500 white, secondary
   meta: Roboto 12/400 muted ink rgb(158,167,177). Existing
   .buyorder-row inherits font-family from ship #75's body rule but
   the inner .buyorder-title + .buyorder-sub never got pinned —
   tokens drift to whatever the cascade lands on (often an oklch
